' Exercises shared semantic diagnostics for invalid game-language use.
CLEAR RED
DRAW CIRCLE 100, 100, 20, WHITE
PLAY SOUND ""
PLAY MUSIC ""
MUSIC VOLUME TRUE
FILL QUADRILATERAL 0, 0, 10
LOAD SavedValue FROM "" DEFAULT 0
SAVE SavedValue TO ""

DO
    GAME WINDOW "Nested" SIZE 0 BY 540
LOOP UNTIL TRUE
